      "content": "That's a good start for the overview. I want to dig deeper into that first point though—the idea of \"preventing disruption of societal structures.\" \n\nIf I'm writing this from the perspective of a 1950s policymaker who believes they are being \"practical\" rather than just hateful, how would they explain the link between racial integration and social chaos? Like, what was the specific logic they used to claim that mixing different groups would inevitably lead to the breakdown of law and order or the collapse of economic stability? I need to make the argument sound cohesive for the essay.",
